OL,3,A'I'll think of you each step of the
OL,4,Away' - Taylor Swift leads tributes
OL,5,Aafter Dolly Parton dies aged 80
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I'll think of you each step of the
OL,8,Fway" - Taylor Swift leads tributes to
OL,9,Fcountry music icon Dolly Parton, who
OL,10,Fhas died at the age of 80
OL,12,FParton died on Tuesday after a "brief
OL,13,Fbattle with cancer", her management
OL,14,Fteam says
OL,16,FBeyonce calls the singer her "north
OL,17,Fstar", Sir Paul McCartney says it's
OL,18,F"hard to imagine" a world without
OL,19,FDolly, and Oprah says "we are all
OL,20,Fbetter because she was here"
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
