OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'I'll think of you each step of the
OL,4,Away' - Taylor Swift leads tributes
OL,5,Aafter Dolly Parton dies aged 80
OL,6,
OL,7,FFans laid flowers on Parton's star
OL,8,Foutside the Country Music Hall of Fame,
OL,9,Fwhile the Empire State Building lit up
OL,10,Fin pink to honour her
OL,12,FThe country icon sold more than 100
OL,13,Fmillion records worldwide, and wrote
OL,14,Fover 3,000 songs in a career that
OL,15,Fspanned six decades
OL,17,FShe also devoted decades of her life to
OL,18,Fcharitable causes, particularly child
OL,19,Fliteracy and education
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
